# Commit messages (personal projects)

Use [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/):

- Subject: `feat(scope): short imperative summary` or `fix(scope): …`, `docs:`, `chore:`, etc.
- No Jira/bracket ticket IDs unless the target repo uses them.
- Body optional; include when the why is not obvious from the subject.
